I have a problem starting Build Appliance + systemd.

It looks like it checks for /dev/sda1 for 4 minutes and then can't start 
programs on /dev/ttyS0 or can't correctly mount /.

I've checked /etc/fstab for Yocto published official BA image (without 
systemd) and my own BA image (with systemd) and I see they are identical 
(see BuildAppliance_problem2.png).

Possibly it is systemd automount problem. Any suggestions?


